Inspiration, 1-bit artwork, face sequences, HUD layout, Mocute mapping,
and several overlay behaviours were taken from Toaster Blaster:

  https://github.com/diodeface/ToasterBlaster
  Copyright (C) diodeface and contributors
  Licensed under GNU AGPL v3.0

This firmware is a personal adaptation: retargeted from MAX7219 modules
to a P3 RGB 64x32 visor, with behaviour changed for this helmet. A
substantial part of the new implementation was written with AI
assistance in Cursor. It is not an official Toaster Blaster release.

T-Rex runner sprites (assets/dino_offline.png) are from Chromium's
offline dinosaur game:

  https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromium/src/+/main/components/neterror/resources/
  Copyright (c) The Chromium Authors
  BSD-style Chromium license

The packed Bad Apple!! clip (assets/badapple.ba1p) is a 1-bit downscale
of the Touhou PV (YouTube FtutLA63Cp8). It is a third-party work, not
original kotoproto art, and is not claimed as such.

